<p>Explosive Steam Engine vapour now lingers for 5 turns.</p><p>Each turn, bleeding foes inside the cloud will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">50, 67, 80, 92, 102</acronym> fire damage.</p><p>Any steamtech-using creature will also regenerate <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> additional steam per turn while inside the cloud.</p><p>Damage scales with your Steampower.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Modern technology at the service of burnination!</span></span></p>